WEBVTT

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:33.440
Oh, kitty, I don't have anything!

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:39.020
What is wrong with you? Stop it, kitty!

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:42.730
Oh, kitty, that's a bad goddamn kitty!

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:50.470
Hi, cat.

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:54.310
Fine. I broke the fall with my face.

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:12.200
Kids of America. It's hand-painted wooden ball in a cup. Who needs constant electronic

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:15.020
video stimulation when there's ball in a cup?

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:37.880
What's in the box, okay? What's in the box?

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:39.220
It's a surprise!

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:56.340
We're sending somebody!

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:07.680
Anybody else want to negotiate?

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:11.370
W-w-w-w-where did he learn to negotiate like that?

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:12.390
I wonder.

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:40.820
Just get it out of your system.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:41.740
No, I'm fine.

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:42.380
I insist.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.920
You can work together better if you just got out of your system.

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:45.780
Bloody mole!

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:50.100
We're not supposed to talk about the bloody mole, but there's a bloody mole winking me in the face.

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:53.920
I'm going to chirp it off and cut it up and make some guacamole.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:56.660
Better?

00:03:30.956 --> 00:03:31.456
SCAR!

00:03:33.996 --> 00:03:34.716
Brother!

00:03:35.372 --> 00:03:36.292
Help me!

00:03:39.564 --> 00:03:41.564
Thanks for watching!

00:03:53.644 --> 00:03:54.824
Just delicious

00:03:54.824 --> 00:03:55.324
Deca-

00:03:55.532 --> 00:03:56.032
Chao!

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:58.236
Thank you for watching!

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:00.000
What?

00:04:30.124 --> 00:04:30.404
I begin.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:33.720
Just my medicine boy
